        {
          "q": "本次从 designs/prds 导入的产品面缺口？",
          "answer": "R3 real-usability（in-progress/partial）+ R4 first-run（target/unknown）为产品场景缺口；原 1-1..1-8 仅覆盖 owner 层 fail-closed 加固，未覆盖产品场景。新增 1-9（R4）/1-10（R3），C7 真实世界部分并入 1-3-5。",
          "note": "判定依据：pd-first-run-onboarding / ep-first-run-journey / ps-solo-real-provider / ps-safe-stop-unknown 的 status 字段"
        }
